# ROOFCAT: standing on a hidden spot calls down a lost letter worth 500.
# Three letters in one run earn the Beacon; score alone does not.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 0
wait 10
cheat score 15000
expect goals !& 1
cheat put 60 83
wait 5
cheat spot 60 80
wait 40
expect letters == 1
cheat spot 60 80
wait 40
cheat spot 60 80
wait 40
expect letters == 3
expect goals & 1
